    from the published images. Map data © OpenStreetMap contributors; each stop is placed where its photo was taken,
    lodging and home are never marked, and the dashed lines show the order of stops, not the exact roads.</small></p>
  <p class="muted"><small>Some photos in this post are my wife's.</small></p>
